<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 310" role="img" aria-label="Two groups of bars. Without a gate, the served requests have a median of 526 milliseconds and a 99th percentile of 562, in red. With the gate at 8, the median is 105 and the 99th percentile 278.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Same 40 clients, same 4 slots: latency of the requests that were served</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng 40 client, cùng 4 slot: độ trễ của các request được phục vụ</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>no gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không có cổng</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="98" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>p50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p50</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="80" width="447" height="24" class="bar" />
    <text x="597" y="98" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>526 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>526 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="132" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>p99</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p99</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="114" width="478" height="24" class="rbar" />
    <text x="628" y="132" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>562 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>562 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="178" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>gate at 8</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cổng ở mức 8</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="210" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>p50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p50</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="192" width="89" height="24" class="bar" />
    <text x="239" y="210" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>105 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>105 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="244" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>p99</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p99</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="226" width="236" height="24" class="bar" />
    <text x="386" y="244" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>278 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>278 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="292" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>median of 5 runs by p99; the gate's five p99 values were 206 to 622 ms, the no-gate runs 546 to 635 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lấy lần chạy ở giữa trong 5 lần theo p99; p99 của bản có cổng dao động 206 đến 622 ms, bản không cổng 546 đến 635 ms</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The gate trades 124 refusals for answers that come back five times sooner. Refusing early is cheaper than answering late.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cổng đổi 124 lần từ chối lấy câu trả lời về sớm gấp năm lần. Từ chối sớm rẻ hơn trả lời muộn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

